---
import { site } from '@/data/site';
---

<div class="min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center px-6">
  <div class="max-w-md w-full">
    <h1 class="text-xl text-neutral-200 mb-4">小空の部屋</h1>
    <p class="text-neutral-400 leading-loose text-sm">ただいまサイトを改修しています。<br />しばらくお待ちください。</p>
    <p class="mt-8 text-neutral-500 text-sm">ご連絡は <a href={`mailto:${site.contactEmail}`} class="text-neutral-300 underline underline-offset-4 decoration-neutral-600 hover:decoration-neutral-300">{site.contactEmail}</a> まで。</p>
  </div>
</div>
